  "description": "The Elf Bar 600 Prefilled Pod Kit represents a significant evolution in the brand's celebrated lineup, transforming their most successful disposable vape into a more sustainable, cost-effective pod system. This innovative device retains everything vapers value about the original – intuitive operation, clean design, and consistently outstanding flavours – while introducing a smarter approach to everyday vaping. Built around a dependable 500mAh rechargeable battery and featuring prefilled, replaceable 2ml pods, this refined system delivers up to 600 puffs per pod, maintaining the same satisfying experience Elf Bar users expect. Each pod contains 2ml of 20mg nicotine salt e-liquid, ensuring a crisp, satisfying mouth-to-lung (MTL) draw and rapid nicotine relief. The device's classic minimalist design focuses on pure functionality, eliminating unnecessary complexity while delivering premium performance in a pocket-friendly form factor. Just as before, using the Elf Bar 600 requires no buttons or adjustments to operate– simply insert a pod and inhale. Its plug-and-play pod system makes refreshing your favourite flavour or experimenting with other flavours in the Elf Bar collection, effortless. For vapers seeking a more sustainable device without compromising on quality or convenience, the Elf Bar 600 delivers the same outstanding performance that made the original a vaping icon, now in a format that reduces waste while offering better long-term value. Elf Bar 600 Prefilled Kit Flavours • Apple Peach • Banana Ice • Blue Razz Lemonade • Blueberry • Blueberry Sour Raspberry • Cherry Cola • Cherry Ice • Grape • Kiwi Passionfruit Guava • Mad Blue • Mango • Pink Lemonade • Spearmint • Strawberry Ice • Strawberry Kiwi • Strawberry Raspberry Cherry Ice • Watermelon • Peach Ice • P&B Cloud • Strawberry Snow • Elfturbo Ice • Watermelon BG • Blueberry Cranberry Cherry • Pink Grapefruit • Snow Tobacco • Watermelon Strawberry • Blueberry Raspberry Please Note: This kit does NOT come with a USB-C cable Shop Elf Bar 600 Refill Pods",
